# Feature business synchronization

When product work adds, changes, releases, previews, or deprecates user-visible behavior, apply `.cursor/skills/sync-businessflow-feature/SKILL.md` before considering the feature complete.

`../businessflow` owns business state, positioning, business model, sales enablement, promotion, and landing requirements. Product code and tests in this repository remain the technical source of truth.

Do not market roadmap items as released. Do not invent pricing, customer evidence, compliance, benchmarks, or release dates.
